@startuml
title Frontend–Backend Interaction (Fetch Events)

actor User
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "Calendar API" as API
participant "CalendarService" as Service
participant "EventRepository" as Repo
database "calendar.db" as DB

User -> UI : Open Calendar Page
UI -> API : GET /calendar/events
API -> Service : fetchEvents()
Service -> Repo : getEventsByUser()
Repo -> DB : SELECT * FROM events WHERE user_id=?
DB --> Repo : results
Repo --> Service : events
Service --> API : events
API --> UI : JSON response
UI --> User : Render events

@enduml
